<import src="../../templates/shared.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><template wx:if="{{!vehicle && !error}}" is="onboarding"/><block wx:if="{{vehicle}}"><template is="vehicle-switch" data="{{vehicle,vehicles,vehicleIndex}}"/><view class="title">好好养护，安心出发</view><view class="subtitle">时间与里程，双重提醒。</view><view class="notice">当前已记录 {{mileage.mileage}} km · 更新于 {{mileage.date}}。<view>站内提醒依据已录入里程，记账时请及时更新。</view></view><view wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><template is="plan-summary" data="{{plan:item}}"/><view class="actions"><button class="quiet" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="editPlan">编辑计划</button><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="completePlan" wx:if="{{item.status !== '已完成'}}" disabled="{{vehicle.archived}}">记录已完成</button></view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!plans.length}}"><view class="muted">添加保养、保险或年检等自定义提醒。</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="addPlan" disabled="{{vehicle.archived}}">＋ 新建养护计划</button><view class="section"><text class="section-title">保养历史</text></view><template is="records" data="{{records}}"/><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!records.length}}">完成计划时可同时记录费用与实际里程。</view><view class="footer-note">按车辆手册设置周期。本版提供站内提醒，尚未接入微信订阅通知。</view></block></view>
